# Residential proxy pool for the proxy-local extension — PLACEHOLDER.
#
# Copy to omp-server/extensions/proxies.txt (this exact directory: the extension
# resolves `${EXT_DIR}/proxies.txt`) and fill with real entries. NEVER commit a
# filled proxies.txt — it holds host:port:user:pass credentials.
#
# Line format (the ` |` cells after the first are optional metadata):
#   host:port:user:pass |last:YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS |dur:12s
#
# `last:` is what the LRU rotation sorts on — the oldest-unused entry is handed to
# the next run, so N concurrent runs spread across N distinct egress IPs.
# Blank lines and unparsable lines are skipped.
#
# --- EXAMPLE (documentation IPs — not a working proxy) ---
198.51.100.10:8000:REPLACE_WITH_USER:REPLACE_WITH_PASS
198.51.100.11:8000:REPLACE_WITH_USER:REPLACE_WITH_PASS |last:2026-10-07 09:00:00 |dur:8s